                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "biopsies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                        "entry_id": "587f63f1-56ba-3488-88d9-a01dc8c5827e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prélèvement d'une portion de tissu d'un organe d'un organisme vivant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b76200d-cdb1-49cf-ba18-e5a1aa9b3bab",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie digestive"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61de5990-129d-4a3c-9601-848e9425683a",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie ostéo-médullaire"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "135d5749-4e4d-4b5a-ac83-2aa86b1da871",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie bronchique"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1904dda0-3fd9-48e7-80d2-c9c2bd75a5b0",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie cutanée"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a7de52e-c024-421b-9713-35e254e09d3c",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie salivaire"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d97fdd73-6d1d-47bf-821a-80f5afc974b4",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie profonde"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4047cbc-1d78-4843-a897-620ce5819aff",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "biopsie du cerveau"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2444b4d6-5897-49d5-ad4a-37721dfb9ce8",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "La biopsie nerveuse a essentiellement une place pour le diagnostic étiologique de certaines neuropathies douloureuses (par exemple, amylose, vascularite)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41fa95b8-b071-4733-ae48-5266c9059d89",
                                "sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                                "text": "Les images laissaient apparaître une tumeur de forte taille, mais on ne pouvait pas dire à ce stade si elle était cancéreuse ou non, une biopsie était nécessaire."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "717a9ad4-45c8-4dc3-8307-c451fd677ded",
                        "source_entry_id": "587f63f1-56ba-3488-88d9-a01dc8c5827e",
                        "source_sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Biopsie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Biopsie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25b1b0ca-eb7a-3ba5-9b51-71359e8bb92a",
                                        "entry_id": "cf058b91-4f64-30a7-bc71-d0e8d3794f8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Entnahme und Untersuchung von Gewebematerial, einer Gewebeprobe, aus einem lebenden Organismus"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4a2a546-31d0-46b8-84b4-4a62a233f318",
                                                "sense_id": "25b1b0ca-eb7a-3ba5-9b51-71359e8bb92a",
                                                "text": "„Erstmals spüre ich tiefe Angst. Ein mir bekannter Urologe rät noch von einer Biopsie ab. Ein gutes Jahr vergeht; 2006 ist der Wert auf 3,6 gestiegen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67eee2d5-dc70-4a92-8765-5359e0a37593",
                                                "sense_id": "25b1b0ca-eb7a-3ba5-9b51-71359e8bb92a",
                                                "text": "„Weil durch das Kernspinntomogramm die Art des Tumors nicht zu ermitteln war, musste Herman im Juni 1988 eine schmerzhafte Biopsie über sich ergehen lassen, bei der ein Loch in die Schädeldecke gebohrt und eine Probe des Tumorgewebes entnommen wurde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bfbd552-a4cd-45f7-999f-d076ae48b229",
                                                "sense_id": "25b1b0ca-eb7a-3ba5-9b51-71359e8bb92a",
                                                "text": "„Er hat die Biopsie gemacht.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d81848c2-fcda-409a-8588-f84b98ad9fb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "587f63f1-56ba-3488-88d9-a01dc8c5827e",
                        "source_sense_id": "06186200-9099-3f96-96d2-cd89bd3f9de5",
                        "target_lang_word": "biopsy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "biopsy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3a79e9f-d3f9-3b4a-aca9-4ca16eaea203",
                                        "entry_id": "a5383ec7-39a4-30c8-9713-c33df9eed10b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The removal and examination of a sample of tissue, cells, or bodily fluid from a living body for diagnostic purposes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3b12343-057e-4864-9ab2-5393146d36b4",
                                                "sense_id": "f3a79e9f-d3f9-3b4a-aca9-4ca16eaea203",
                                                "text": "We will need to perform a biopsy to determine whether the tumour is malignant or benign."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab8cdd58-ea4a-447c-aac2-08ef69ba7721",
                                                "sense_id": "f3a79e9f-d3f9-3b4a-aca9-4ca16eaea203",
                                                "text": "All the while he was talking, he took lots of biopsies, small samples of tissue to be examined by pathologists using a microscope."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "biopsy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41055526-db47-3ac3-a2ab-eab79f06c8eb",
                                        "entry_id": "ecae4d40-7128-3b96-8f96-c6b04607aca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take a sample (a biopsy) for pathological examination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad7bb78b-55c3-48b7-aafd-1cf3536fbc6f",
                                                "sense_id": "41055526-db47-3ac3-a2ab-eab79f06c8eb",
                                                "text": "They biopsied the lump but it turned out to be non-cancerous."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e0383859-15d0-471e-a4f3-56d14512c9a7",
                        "source_entry_id": "587f63f1-56ba-3488-88d9-a01dc8c5827e",
